      "{FileName: KnightLaw_FAQs.md}\n{H1: Frequently Asked Questions (Initial Intake Call)}\n### I bought my Tesla/Rivian/Lucid NEW; can you assist me?\n\n**A:** The Tesla cases we’ve had in the past have gone to arbitration because the consumer, at the time of purchase, agreed to go directly into arbitration with Tesla over any conflict. We do not go to arbitration, we file lawsuits. Therefore, we are unable to assist you.\n### Do you help consumers who have used vehicles?\n\n**A:** Only if the vehicle was sold used CPO (Certified pre-owned) or used – dealer demo. If it was used without being CPO or a dealer demo, no, unfortunately we cannot help.\n\n---"
